.IX Title "Lucy::Search::Matcher 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::Matcher 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Search::Matcher \- Match a set of document ids.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\&    # abstract base class
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
A Matcher iterates over a set of ascending document ids.  Some Matchers
implement \fBscore()\fR and can assign relevance scores to the docs that they
match.  Other implementations may be match-only.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.IX Header "CONSTRUCTORS"
.SS new
.IX Subsection "new"
.Vb 1
\&    my $matcher = MyMatcher\->SUPER::new;
.Ve
.PP
Abstract constructor.
.SH "ABSTRACT METHODS"
.IX Header "ABSTRACT METHODS"
.SS next
.IX Subsection "next"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $matcher\->next();
.Ve
.PP
Proceed to the next doc id.
.PP
Returns: A positive doc id, or 0 once the iterator is exhausted.
.SS get_doc_id
.IX Subsection "get_doc_id"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $matcher\->get_doc_id();
.Ve
.PP
Return the current doc id.  Valid only after a successful call to
\&\fBnext()\fR or \fBadvance()\fR and must not be called otherwise.
.SS score
.IX Subsection "score"
.Vb 1
\&    my $float = $matcher\->score();
.Ve
.PP
Return the score of the current document.
.PP
Only Matchers which are used for scored search need implement \fBscore()\fR.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS advance
.IX Subsection "advance"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $matcher\->advance($target);
.Ve
.PP
Advance the iterator to the first doc id greater than or equal to
\&\f(CW\*(C`target\*(C'\fR. The default implementation simply calls \fBnext()\fR
over and over, but subclasses have the option of doing something more
efficient.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBtarget\fR \- A positive doc id, which must be greater than the current
doc id once the iterator has been initialized.
.PP
Returns: A positive doc id, or 0 once the iterator is exhausted.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Search::Matcher isa Clownfish::Obj.
